# Task 12 — Net.Connect with multi-parameter EffectCategory. Probes
# EffectDecl arity/type mismatch against a (String, Int) category.
# A Handler intercepts the Network.Connect call and returns 42, so
# the program is deterministic without an actual network call.
# Uses the implicit prelude for intT, stringT, add.
@v=1 root=outer
connectFx EFC "Network.Connect" [stringT intT]
connectT FNT [stringT intT] intT [connectFx]
connect FN "strand-builtin:Net.Connect" connectT [connectFx]
host STR "localhost"
port ILT 8080
connectDecl EFD connectFx [host port]
callConnect APP connect [host port] [] [connectDecl]
addOne APP add [callConnect 1]
handleLam LAM [h:stringT p:intT] 42
outer H connectFx handleLam addOne
